WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Ye Xuande, please issue an imperial edict immediately

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,600
Call the world, you are the orthodox one

3
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,860
Ling the Queen Mother and King Zhennan died suddenly

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,180
Its enemy palm leaves Guang

5
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,660
While Ye Xuanyuan is in the capital,

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,020
Inherited the position of King of Zhennan

7
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:17,260
The Queen Mother, Chen Yuan led troops to attack the rebels

8
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,620
Chen's eldest brother, Ye Guang, served to seize the throne and was the most evil person.

9
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:21,300
Chen begged the Queen Mother to give Chen a chance

10
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,140
Kill him with your hands and take back the throne

11
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,100
Ye Xuan, it’s time for you to get married, right?

12
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:29,860
The Ai family remembers that the girl from Shanyuan has been following you all these years.

13
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,860
The Ai family sees what happened between you two.

14
00:00:32,980 --> 00:00:34,500
Yue'er's parents have been kings since childhood

15
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,100
I brought him up single-handedly

16
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,260
If you marry Shanyue

17
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,860
He is the son-in-law of my official family

18
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,060
There will be no internal opposition

19
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:43,020
I can give this young sage to you

20
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:46,090
Why, don’t want to

21
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:54,390
I am willing

22
00:00:54,390 --> 00:00:57,070
From now on you are husband and wife

23
00:00:57,070 --> 00:01:01,720
Support each other and understand each other

24
00:01:01,720 --> 00:01:04,680
If it had been the case, it would have been a pity

25
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:12,550
But now, I finally have all the regrets of the past. Maybe Ye Xuan

26
00:01:12,550 --> 00:01:13,830
do you know

27
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:15,830
Why does the Ai family value you so much?

28
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,380
I don’t know

29
00:01:17,380 --> 00:01:19,780
Because you look like a person

30
00:01:19,780 --> 00:01:22,740
Ye Xuan, your future will never end with King Zhennan.

31
00:01:22,740 --> 00:01:23,740
Wait for the situation to stabilize

32
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:25,380
The Ai family will ask Ye Xuande to give way

33
00:01:25,380 --> 00:01:26,980
Aijiahui ascends the throne and proclaims himself emperor

34
00:01:26,980 --> 00:01:29,270
But Aijia’s ambition is not here

35
00:01:29,270 --> 00:01:30,510
Status is just a springboard

36
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:32,870
Aijia is going to a wider world
